---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---
<Base title="Privacy | Chandragiri guide" description="Scope of cookies, optional Google Analytics consent, independent Cloudflare hosting measurement, weather service and external links." noindex lang="en">
  <section class="section"><div class="shell prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>This is an independent, unofficial, non-profit travel and educational guide. It does not sell tickets, sign in users, create accounts or provide a contact form.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>We do not automatically collect personally identifiable information from your browser or device. Only after you consent does optional Google Analytics measure page usage, browser/device and a cookie summary; it does not include your name, email or address.</p>

    <h2>How we use information</h2>
    <p>Collected information is used only to maintain and improve this site. We do not sell your personal information or share it with third parties for marketing.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
    <p>Necessary cookies (language preference, storing your choice, security) are always active and cannot be turned off. Analytics cookies (Google Analytics) load only after you consent. This site does not use its own marketing or advertising cookies. More at <a href="/en/cookie-settings/">Cookie settings</a>.</p>

    <h2>Third-party services and links</h2>
    <p>Hosting measurement (Cloudflare Web Analytics) is independent of the Google Analytics choice; it may measure visits, page views, URL path, referrer, browser/device and performance, but there is no separate switch to disable it. Weather data is requested by the browser from this site's endpoint and fetched by the server from Open-Meteo; your device location is not requested and the browser does not contact the provider directly. Google Maps is not embedded; opening the map, tickets or other external links is subject to that provider's terms. Current images are served from this site.</p>
    <p><a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/data-metrics/">Cloudflare data docs</a> · <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google privacy</a> · <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/terms">Open-Meteo terms</a></p>

    <h2>Data security</h2>
    <p>We work to protect your data, but no internet transmission or storage can be guaranteed 100% secure.</p>

    <p class="small">Privacy reviewed: 2026-11-09.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
